      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:vbm1r3'
    '|b||A hundred dollars. A month''s wait cost a third more; a whole decade, under seven times as much.':
